%N A093314 Number of permutations s_1,s_2,...,s_n of 1,2,...,n with s_1 = 3 and such that for all j=1,2,...,n, s_j divides Sum_{i=1..j} s_i.
%C A093314 The beginning elements of the permutation are 3,1,(either 2 or 4),...
%C A093314 The total number of permutations with this property is given in A067957.
